cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the original comparison paper for the scientific models and findings.
  Also credit DReaM-ALD and Machball for implementation lineage. If using this
  archive or its packaging, acknowledge Zihao Bai and version 0.1.0.
type: software
title: "ALD conformality: a two-model MATLAB reproduction"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
authors:
  - family-names: Bai
    given-names: Zihao
abstract: >-
  A preserved MATLAB reproduction of diffusion-reaction and ballistic
  transport-reaction models for lateral high-aspect-ratio ALD channels.
  Includes historical metrics with provenance, bilingual documentation,
  a portable recording interface, figure exports, and small-system checks.
  The release retains inherited numerical choices and their documented
  limitations; it does not rerun or claim validation of every full-scale case.
keywords:
  - atomic layer deposition
  - conformality
  - diffusion-reaction
  - ballistic transport-reaction
  - absorbing Markov chain
  - MATLAB
  - research reproducibility
